  "sentences": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_1",
      "speaker": "小明",
      "text": "这个周末我想去公园走走，你觉得怎么样？",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 3320,
      "durationMs": 3320,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_2",
      "speaker": "小丽",
      "text": "好啊，但是天气有点冷，我们下午去吧。",
      "startMs": 3970,
      "endMs": 7680,
      "durationMs": 3710,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_3",
      "speaker": "小明",
      "text": "可以，那我们在公园门口见，两点怎么样？",
      "startMs": 8180,
      "endMs": 12150,
      "durationMs": 3970,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_4",
      "speaker": "小丽",
      "text": "没问题。对了，我们可以带点吃的和喝的。",
      "startMs": 12800,
      "endMs": 17080,
      "durationMs": 4280,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_5",
      "speaker": "小明",
      "text": "好主意，我买一些水果和面包，你带水吧。",
      "startMs": 17580,
      "endMs": 21050,
      "durationMs": 3470,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_6",
      "speaker": "小丽",
      "text": "行。我还可以带我的猫一起去，它很喜欢外面。",
      "startMs": 21550,
      "endMs": 26300,
      "durationMs": 4750,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "dpw_7",
      "speaker": "小明",
      "text": "真的吗？那太好了，我也喜欢猫。",
      "startMs": 26800,
      "endMs": 30200,
      "durationMs": 3400,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/dialogue_plan_weekend_dpw_7.mp3"
    }
  ]
